flowchart TD
  user[Browser] --> vue[Vue Explore or Copilot]
  vue --> api[POST /api/chat or /api/discover]
  api --> flag{ENABLE_AGENT_WORKFLOW}
  flag -->|on, default| flow[agents/workflow.py]
  flag -->|off| old{ENABLE_LANGGRAPH and not ENABLE_LLM_AGENT}
  old -->|yes| graph[discovery_graph.py]
  old -->|LLM agent on| legacy[agents/graph.py]
  old -->|both off| direct[DiscoveryService]
  flow --> intent[Intent model plus parser lock]
  intent -->|general question| general[General answer, no retrieval]
  intent -->|restaurant| tools[Discovery tool loop]
  tools --> mcp[MCP stdio: search and reviews]
  mcp --> rank[Rank retrieved ids only]
  rank --> synth[Synthesis from supplied facts]
  graph --> det[Filter, BM25, optional Bing, Python answer]
  direct --> det
  legacy --> det
  synth --> cards[Reply, cards, map pins, evidence]
  det --> cards
